{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.MarkovInteriorBond","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.HeckeSandwichReduces","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.BraidedTowerInstances","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.tr_bondWord_symTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.tr_bondWord_symTrace","kind":"theorem","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L207-L217","doc":"The bond product on the symmetric-group tower (`q = 1`), the corpus's other\n`BraidedTower` instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.tr_bondWord_heckeTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.tr_bondWord_heckeTower","kind":"theorem","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L194-L205","doc":"The bond product on the presented infinite Hecke tower, for any `h` and any root `z` of\nthe Hecke quadratic `z² = h z + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.tr_bondWord_of_braided","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.tr_bondWord_of_braided","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L176-L185","doc":"**The general-`A` bond product on every braided tower**: for a chain with strictly\nincreasing bonds, blocks between them and `x` below the first bond,\n`tr (bondWord) = (∏ (z + d_k)) · tr (freeWord)`. No hypothesis beyond the tower's\ndefining relations and the Markov axioms. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.interiorMarkov_of_braided","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.interiorMarkov_of_braided","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L169-L174","doc":"**`InteriorMarkov` is a theorem of every braided tower.** The hypothesis `qou-gr3t`\ncarried as a bespoke `Prop` is discharged by the Hecke relations alone, through\n`HeckeSandwichReduces.disjointBlock_of_braided`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.toTowerB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.toTowerB","kind":"def","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L166-L167","doc":"A braided Ocneanu tower as a `MarkovTower`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.far_of_braided","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.far_of_braided","kind":"theorem","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L162-L164","doc":"The far-commutation of a braided tower, in the `MarkovTower` orientation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.interiorMarkov_of_disjointBlockMultiplicative","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.interiorMarkov_of_disjointBlockMultiplicative","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L150-L154","doc":"**`InteriorMarkov` for every far-commuting Ocneanu tower satisfying the disjoint-block\nlaw.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.disjointBlock_of_multiplicative","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.disjointBlock_of_multiplicative","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L145-L148","doc":"The corpus's `DisjointBlockMultiplicative` gives the tower-vocabulary `DisjointBlock`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.from_le_shifted","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.from_le_shifted","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L138-L143","doc":"The tower-vocabulary block subalgebra sits inside the corpus's `shifted`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.toTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.toTower","kind":"def","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L122-L134","doc":"An Ocneanu `MarkovTrace` whose generators far-commute is a `MarkovTower`: forget the\ninverse generator and its Markov parameter, keep the filtration, trace and `z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.interiorMarkov_of_disjointBlock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.interiorMarkov_of_disjointBlock","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L102-L114","doc":"**`InteriorMarkov` follows from the disjoint-block law.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.tr_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.tr_σ","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L97-L100","doc":"`tr σ_g = z` when `tr 1 = 1`: the Markov axiom at `a = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.DisjointBlock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.DisjointBlock","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L92-L95","doc":"**The disjoint-block trace law**, in the tower's own vocabulary: for `a` at level `≤ g`\nand `b` generated by the letters at level `≥ g`, the trace is multiplicative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.from_anti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.from_anti","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L84-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.σ_mem_from","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.σ_mem_from","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L81-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.upper_eq_from","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.upper_eq_from","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.from_","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.from_","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower.lean#L74-L77","doc":"The subalgebra generated by the generators at level **`≥ g`**: `σ_g, σ_{g+1}, …`.\n`upper T g` (strictly above `g`) is `from_ T (g + 1)` by definition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}